# World map menu with the D-pad: from state 'town' (inn lobby), unlock the 'Leave town' exit (flag 0x1E1, keeping
# 0x1E2), walk out, pick Leave town (tab 0 row 0) and travel; on the world map menu: Down, Down, Right, Up, Left.
load town
poke u8 0x0220465C 6
press Down 60
wait 150
watch u16 0x020B6BE4 map
watch u16 0x020B8C5C sel
watch u16 0x020B8C5E tab
press Left 3
wait 25
press Up 3
wait 25
shot wm_town
press A 3
wait 300
shot wm_0
press Down 3
wait 40
shot wm_1
press Down 3
wait 40
shot wm_2
press Right 3
wait 40
shot wm_3
press Up 3
wait 40
shot wm_4
press Left 3
wait 40
shot wm_5
press Down 40
wait 20
shot wm_held
